
. set more off

. set linesize 80

. clear

. input x g str12 s

             x          g             s
  1. 1 0 ""
  2. 2 0 ""
  3. 1 1 "alpha beta"
  4. 2 1 "alpha beta"
  5. 1 . "quoted"
  6. 2 . "quoted"
  7. 1 .a "z"
  8. 2 .a "z"
  9. end

